# No environment variables are required anymore — auth moved from NextAuth
# (which needed a Google OAuth client secret) to Firebase Authentication,
# whose client config (lib/firebaseClient.js) is safe to ship in the
# browser bundle, same as it already is inside the extension's
# js/cloudSync.js. This file is kept only so `cp .env.example .env.local`
# still works if you add real env vars later (real billing, etc).
